  "title": "Moxa ioLogik E1212 Ethernet Remote I/O",
  "description": "Thing Model for the Moxa ioLogik E1212 Ethernet remote I/O with 8 digital inputs and 8 jumper-configurable DIO channels over Modbus TCP. It reads input and output states, input event counters, the status words, the watchdog alarm flag, the model name, uptime and firmware identification. Addresses follow the default Modbus addresses in the ioLogik E1200 Series User Manual v16.2, Appendix A. Outputs are read only. LAN IP and MAC registers and the user-set device name are instance data and are omitted. Firmware applicability is not stated; user-defined Modbus addressing changes these addresses. No hardware validation is claimed.",
